" (`3316d25f8 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/3316d25f8>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Subida de versión** que actualiza OpenMV IDE a 1.7.1 sin cambios "
"funcionales (`3316d25f8 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/3316d25f8>`__)."

